{
    "attributes": {
        "author": [
            "Partner Threat Feed"
        ],
        "description": "Identifies processes started from binaries whose SHA-256 hash matches a Fennel Loom loader sample, as reported in campaign PTF-00457. The indicators are synthetic and use reserved address and domain ranges, so they match no real traffic.",
        "false_positives": [
            "Security testing that replays known indicators.",
            "A shared hosting address or domain that later served benign content."
        ],
        "from": "now-9m",
        "index": [
            "logs-endpoint.events.process-*"
        ],
        "language": "eql",
        "license": "Elastic License v2",
        "name": "Fennel Loom Loader: Process started from known malicious binary (PTF-00457)",
        "note": "## Triage and analysis\n\n### Investigating Fennel Loom Loader: Process started from known malicious binary\n\nThis rule matches indicators that the Partner Threat Feed attributes to the Fennel Loom loader in campaign PTF-00457.\n\n### Possible investigation steps\n\n- Review the matching event and the host or user it came from.\n- Look for other indicators from the same campaign on the same host.\n- Check the process tree around the event for the initial execution or delivery.\n\n### Response and remediation\n\n- Isolate the host if the match is confirmed.\n- Block the indicators at the network edge and on endpoints.\n- Reset credentials used on the host.\n",
        "query": "process where event.type == \"start\" and process.hash.sha256 in (\"ce7b106f37e61240fd8ee32ece6bf456ad89a469b63a6210dc897f63ae8bc2c2\", \"6abb9c11a0c6395091810c7fde41af5309f7fc2e7f46621137a43cba684f4698\", \"c4397dfb178477e4038b476bbf4d5053575ecb5172ef5e6414757d7c45899fb6\", \"53678625fd99a0bd9e70ef0622ee6674f55981131646e79864443162bb7720f8\", \"8937aa16bf13d48faba2552aa917edbcafdc768d4a8f6f2633f59dfc925a501d\", \"df23e26cce2d8de2bab6bc1f7671028397afbddcc4cee535ca58e05eedb370d3\", \"727c7ced858b71b66ff1e8164a1958cb2e94b002e6f3337c01255348b14d1f5c\", \"546ce977ab164164bd4972e3d99dfa0c0950d210e5c01d89f6efe85e921f1012\")",
